    "summary": "`POST /v1/alerts/{id}/status` \u2014 queue operation on an alert (claim /\nreview / close) with an audited actor: the caller's verified identity\ndrives the journal entry; the transition is guarded against terminal\nstates (closed alerts never reopen \u2014 a new detection raises a new\nalert).",
    "operationId": "update_alert_status",
    "requestBody": {
     "content": {
      "application/json": {
